{
  "_comment": [
    "Scenes derived from our own prop prompts, by hand, one scene per prompt:",
    "  crate   <- core/cadbakeoff/fixtures/props/crate.build123d.prompt.txt",
    "  chest   <- core/cadbakeoff/fixtures/props/chest.build123d.prompt.txt",
    "  lantern <- core/cadbakeoff/fixtures/props/lantern.build123d.prompt.txt",
    "Our prompts are millimetres, Z up. topview's document is metres, Y up:",
    "the mapping is (x, y, z)_mm/1000 -> (x, z, y)_m. Each cell of a BODIES",
    "block becomes one add_primitive box or cylinder sized to the cell's",
    "extent. The chest's dome is a half-cylinder, which topview's primitive",
    "vocabulary cannot express: it is approximated by a full cylinder and the",
    "approximation is recorded in the report. The lantern's bodies hang below",
    "its static hook block, so every part floats above groundHeight - that is",
    "deliberate: it is the case where the two vocabularies must disagree."
  ],
